<https://id.i2idl.org/concepts/learning-engineering-process> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An iterative, concurrent process for addressing learning challenges by framing the context and stakeholders, creating and instrumenting a solution, implementing it in authentic settings, investigating outcomes with data, and refining the work continuously." <https://id.i2idl.org/graphs/concepts/learning-engineering-process/versions/1> .
